$$
u_I(t)=u_I(0)+K_I\int_0^t e(\tau)\,d\tau,
\qquad
\dot u_I(t)=K_Ie(t).
$$

As long as a constant error remains, the controller keeps changing its output. At an equilibrium with $K_I\ne0$, a constant integrator state requires zero error.

